   "reqd": 1,
   "default": "Out",
   "in_list_view": 1,
   "description": "Growth is value the account gained or lost on its own \u2014 interest, a portfolio moving \u2014 as opposed to money you put in. Kept apart so a return can be told from a contribution, which is the only way to know whether an investment is actually working."
